*.egg
# Negate Python's `lib/` ignore for pi-evaluator (P1.b introduced src/lib/ + test/lib/).
# This is a TypeScript project; the Python `lib/` convention does not apply.
!**/pi-evaluator/src/lib/
!**/pi-evaluator/test/lib/
!**/pi-evaluator/fixtures/**/lib/

